# Shared UI components (RFC-026 · RFC-095 · RFC-106)

Extract **presentation** into the design system; keep **state, fetching, navigation** in feature screens. No peer `shared/widgets/` package.

**Source of truth:** [`packages/forja_foundation`](../../packages/forja_foundation) — `Button`, `ButtonGroup`, `VerticalMenu`, `LogoMenuRail`, tokens/theme. Import the file, not the gallery barrel.

Architecture: [pack-product host](./forja-pack-product-host.mdc). DS widgets: props + callbacks only — no feature god objects.

## Folder map

```
packages/forja_foundation/lib/{tokens,components,widgets,blocks,protocol}/
apps/forja/lib/shell/          # one tree: frame (nav/frame/routing/bus/adapters/chrome) + UI (core/tv/focus/feedback/brand/desktop/update/filters)
apps/forja/lib/shared/engine/runtime/kit/  # thin kit interpreter (layout JSON → DS)
apps/forja/lib/shared/player/sources/
apps/forja/lib/shared/playback/
apps/forja/lib/shared/engine/details/  # title details host wire (not player)
apps/forja/lib/shared/engine/{store,unlock,portals,packs}/
apps/forja/lib/shared/engine/runtime/{kit,search,nav,open,details}/
apps/forja/lib/features/settings/packs/  # pack install UI
forja-packs/hubs/**                     # product
```

Barrel: `package:forja/shared/engine/details/media_details.dart` for details widgets.

## When to extract

| Signal | Action |
|--------|--------|
| Same widget in torrent + streaming details | `media_details/` |
| Same widget in Home hero + details hero | `hero/` |
| Screen-only logic (search, Trakt, gen-token) | Stay in `details_screen.dart` |
| Panel UI vs panel state | Panel widget gets data + callbacks; screen owns `_selectedSourceId`, fetch |

## Media details page shape

Both details screens use:

```dart
MediaDetailsScrollPage(
  hero: MediaDetailsHero(...),
  backdropUrl: ...,
  backgroundColor: ...,
  sections: [/* tv picker, cast, trailers, recommendations */],
)
```

- Section spacing: `DetailsTokens.sectionSpacing` — applied inside scroll page, not per screen.
- Recommendations: `MediaDetailsRecommendationsSection` + screen-specific `onMovieTap`.
- Torrent sources overlay: `TorrentSourcesPanel` + filters/tiles; screen wires chip `onChipTap` to existing handlers.

## Hero overview slots

- Home desktop uses a **fixed-height** overview slot (`ShellTokens.heroOverviewSlotHeightDesktop`).
- `HeroOverviewText` must respect `constraints.hasBoundedHeight` — never let synopsis + Read More overflow the slot.

## Adding a new shared widget

1. Pick a folder from the map above (`hero/`, `media_details/`, `chrome/`, …) — not a flat root file.
2. Export from barrel if in `media_details/`.
3. Use `ShellTokens` / `DetailsTokens` + `ForjaShellColors` + design buttons — no inline style copies from old god files.
4. Update RFC-026 component row if part of the media-details UX arc.

## Do not

- Clone cast/crew UI — use `MediaDetailsCastSection` only.
- Reintroduce `media_details_metadata_sections.dart` (deleted; superseded).
- Put torrent search / Stremio fetch logic inside `torrent_source_tiles.dart`.
